  "description": "Hit the city--or the park or the dirt jumps, on the Haro Mid City complete. Full chromoly frame, fork, bars and cranks with responsive geometry that performs everywhere. Sealed bearings all around, a cassette rear hub and La Mesa 20 X 2.4\" tires provide more bounce to the ounce. Run it with brakes or without--this guy has removable brake mounts for a clean look. The Mid City is the ultimate all-terrain BMX machine at a great price.\nFull chromoly frame with 1-1/8\" steerer tube and mid BB shell; 20.75\" top tube\nFull chromoly with tapered legs & internally threaded 1-piece steerer tube. 32mm offset\nHaro full Chromoly 9\" rise bars. 2-piece design\nHaro Baseline stem\nHaro Baseline grips\nHaro Baseline chromoly 8-spline 19mm cranks 170mm length\nSealed front and rear hubs laced to 36H double wall rims\n25/9 gear ratio\nHaro Baseline 2-piece seat with alloy post\nHaro La Mesa tires 20x2.4\" front/rear",
